<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>ChairTime: Scheduling Built for Barbers</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Online booking, automated reminders, and client management designed for barbershops and independent barbers.">
  <style>
    :root {
      --ink: #1a1a1a;
      --paper: #f7f3ec;
      --accent: #b8332a;
      --accent-dark: #8f241e;
      --muted: #6b6259;
      --card: #ffffff;
      --line: #e4ddd2;
    }

    * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }

    body {
      font-family: "Helvetica Neue", Arial, sans-serif;
      background: var(--paper);
      color: var(--ink);
      line-height: 1.6;
    }

    a { color: inherit; text-decoration: none; }

    .container {
      width: min(1100px, 92%);
      margin: 0 auto;
    }

    /* Header */
    header {
      position: sticky;
      top: 0;
      background: rgba(247, 243, 236, 0.95);
      backdrop-filter: blur(6px);
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
      z-index: 10;
    }

    .nav {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      padding: 1rem 0;
    }

    .logo {
      font-weight: 800;
      font-size: 1.4rem;
      letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    }

    .logo span { color: var(--accent); }

    .nav-links {
      display: flex;
      gap: 1.75rem;
      align-items: center;
    }

    .nav-links a {
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      color: var(--muted);
    }

    .nav-links a:hover { color: var(--ink); }

    /* Buttons */
    .btn {
      display: inline-block;
      padding: 0.85rem 1.6rem;
      border-radius: 6px;
      font-weight: 600;
      font-size: 1rem;
      transition: background 0.2s, transform 0.1s;
      cursor: pointer;
      border: none;
    }

    .btn-primary {
      background: var(--accent);
      color: #fff;
    }

    .btn-primary:hover { background: var(--accent-dark); }

    .btn-primary:active { transform: translateY(1px); }

    .btn-secondary {
      background: transparent;
      color: var(--ink);
      border: 2px solid var(--ink);
    }

    .btn-secondary:hover {
      background: var(--ink);
      color: var(--paper);
    }

    .btn-small {
      padding: 0.5rem 1.1rem;
      font-size: 0.9rem;
    }

    /* Hero */
    .hero {
      padding: 5rem 0 4rem;
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1.1fr 1fr;
      gap: 3rem;
      align-items: center;
    }

    .eyebrow {
      display: inline-block;
      font-size: 0.8rem;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.12em;
      color: var(--accent);
      font-weight: 700;
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
    }

    h1 {
      font-size: clamp(2.4rem, 5vw, 3.6rem);
      line-height: 1.1;
      letter-spacing: -0.03em;
      margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
    }

    .hero p.lead {
      font-size: 1.15rem;
      color: var(--muted);
      margin-bottom: 2rem;
      max-width: 34rem;
    }

    .cta-row {
      display: flex;
      gap: 1rem;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    }

    .fineprint {
      font-size: 0.875rem;
      color: var(--muted);
    }

    /* Booking mockup */
    .mockup {
      background: var(--card);
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius: 14px;
      padding: 1.5rem;
      box-shadow: 0 20px 50px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
    }

    .mockup-header {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
      padding-bottom: 1rem;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
    }

    .mockup-header h3 { font-size: 1rem; }

    .mockup-header small {
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 0.8rem;
    }

    .slot-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
      gap: 0.6rem;
      margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
    }

    .slot {
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius: 8px;
      padding: 0.65rem;
      text-align: center;
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      font-weight: 500;
    }

    .slot.taken {
      background: #f1ede6;
      color: #b5ada2;
      text-decoration: line-through;
    }

    .slot.selected {
      background: var(--accent);
      color: #fff;
      border-color: var(--accent);
    }

    .appt-summary {
      background: var(--paper);
      border-radius: 8px;
      padding: 0.9rem 1rem;
      font-size: 0.9rem;
    }

    .appt-summary strong { display: block; margin-bottom: 0.2rem; }

    /* Logos / trust bar */
    .trust {
      border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
      padding: 1.5rem 0;
      text-align: center;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 0.9rem;
    }

    .trust-stats {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      gap: 3.5rem;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      margin-top: 1rem;
    }

    .trust-stats div strong {
      display: block;
      font-size: 1.8rem;
      color: var(--ink);
      letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    }

    /* Sections */
    section.block {
      padding: 5rem 0;
    }

    .section-head {
      text-align: center;
      max-width: 40rem;
      margin: 0 auto 3.5rem;
    }

    .section-head h2 {
      font-size: clamp(1.9rem, 3.5vw, 2.6rem);
      letter-spacing: -0.02em;
      line-height: 1.15;
      margin-bottom: 0.9rem;
    }

    .section-head p {
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 1.05rem;
    }

    /* Features */
    .features {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
      gap: 1.5rem;
    }

    .feature {
      background: var(--card);
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius: 12px;
      padding: 2rem 1.75rem;
    }

    .icon {
      width: 44px;
      height: 44px;
      border-radius: 10px;
      background: var(--accent);
      color: #fff;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      font-size: 1.25rem;
      margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
    }

    .feature h3 {
      font-size: 1.15rem;
      margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    }

    .feature p {
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 0.97rem;
    }

    /* How it works */
    .steps {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
      gap: 2rem;
      counter-reset: step;
    }

    .step {
      padding-top: 1.5rem;
      border-top: 3px solid var(--ink);
    }

    .step-num {
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: var(--accent);
      letter-spacing: 0.1em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      margin-bottom: 0.6rem;
      display: block;
    }

    .step h3 {
      font-size: 1.2rem;
      margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    }

    .step p {
      color: var(--muted);
    }

    /* Pricing */
    .pricing-section {
      background: var(--ink);
      color: var(--paper);
    }

    .pricing-section .section-head p { color: #bdb5a9; }

    .plans {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
      gap: 1.5rem;
      align-items: stretch;
    }

    .plan {
      background: #242424;
      border: 1px solid #333;
      border-radius: 12px;
      padding: 2.25rem 2rem;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
    }

    .plan.featured {
      border: 2px solid var(--accent);
      position: relative;
    }

    .plan-badge {
      position: absolute;
      top: -13px;
      left: 50%;
      transform: translateX(-50%);
      background: var(--accent);
      color: #fff;
      font-size: 0.75rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      padding: 0.3rem 0.8rem;
      border-radius: 999px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    }

    .plan h3 { font-size: 1.2rem; margin-bottom: 0.4rem; }

    .price {
      font-size: 2.8rem;
      font-weight: 800;
      letter-spacing: -0.03em;
      margin: 0.75rem 0 0.25rem;
    }

    .price small {
      font-size: 1rem;
      font-weight: 400;
      color: #bdb5a9;
    }

    .plan-desc {
      color: #bdb5a9;
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    }

    .plan ul {
      list-style: none;
      margin-bottom: 2rem;
      flex-grow: 1;
    }

    .plan li {
      padding: 0.45rem 0;
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      border-bottom: 1px solid #2f2f2f;
    }

    .plan li::before {
      content: "✓ ";
      color: var(--accent);
      font-weight: 700;
    }

    .plan .btn { text-align: center; }

    /* Testimonials */
    .quotes {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
      gap: 1.5rem;
    }

    .quote {
      background: var(--card);
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius: 12px;
      padding: 2rem;
    }

    .quote p {
      font-size: 1rem;
      margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
      font-style: italic;
    }

    .quote-author strong { display: block; font-size: 0.95rem; }
    .quote-author span { color: var(--muted); font-size: 0.85rem; }

    /* Final CTA */
    .final-cta {
      text-align: center;
      padding: 5rem 0;
      background: var(--accent);
      color: #fff;
    }

    .final-cta h2 {
      font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 2.9rem);
      letter-spacing: -0.02em;
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
    }

    .final-cta p {
      font-size: 1.1rem;
      opacity: 0.92;
      margin-bottom: 2rem;
    }

    .final-cta .btn-primary {
      background: #fff;
      color: var(--accent);
    }

    .final-cta .btn-primary:hover {
      background: var(--paper);
    }

    /* Footer */
    footer {
      padding: 2.5rem 0;
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      color: var(--muted);
    }

    .footer-inner {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 1rem;
    }

    .footer-links {
      display: flex;
      gap: 1.5rem;
    }

    .footer-links a:hover { color: var(--ink); }

    /* Responsive */
    @media (max-width: 900px) {
      .hero { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .features, .plans, .quotes, .steps { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .nav-links a:not(.btn) { display: none; }
    }

    @media (max-width: 500px) {
      .hero { padding-top: 3rem; }
      .slot-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <header>
    <div class="container nav">
      <a href="#" class="logo">Chair<span>Time</span></a>
      <nav class="nav-links">
        <a href="#features">Features</a>
        <a href="#how">How it works</a>
        <a href="#pricing">Pricing</a>
        <a href="#" class="btn btn-primary btn-small">Start free trial</a>
      </nav>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main>

    <!-- Hero -->
    <section class="hero container">
      <div>
        <span class="eyebrow">Scheduling for barbers</span>
        <h1>Fill your chair. Skip the phone tag.</h1>
        <p class="lead">
          ChairTime gives your clients a simple way to book, reschedule, and pay online,
          while automated reminders cut no-shows and keep your calendar full.
        </p>
        <div class="cta-row">
          <a href="#" class="btn btn-primary">Start your 14-day free trial</a>
          <a href="#how" class="btn btn-secondary">See how it works</a>
        </div>
        <p class="fineprint">No credit card required. Works with solo chairs and full shops.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="mockup" aria-label="Booking preview">
        <div class="mockup-header">
          <h3>Book with Marcus</h3>
          <small>Fade &amp; beard · 45 min</small>
        </div>
        <div class="slot-grid">
          <div class="slot taken">9:00</div>
          <div class="slot">9:30</div>
          <div class="slot taken">10:00</div>
          <div class="slot selected">10:30</div>
          <div class="slot">11:00</div>
          <div class="slot">11:30</div>
        </div>
        <div class="appt-summary">
          <strong>Thursday, 10:30 AM</strong>
          Confirmation and reminder texts sent automatically.
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Trust bar -->
    <section class="trust">
      <div class="container">
        <p>Trusted by barbers and barbershops across the country</p>
        <div class="trust-stats">
          <div><strong>38%</strong>fewer no-shows</div>
          <div><strong>12 hrs</strong>saved per week, on average</div>
          <div><strong>24/7</strong>online booking</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Features -->
    <section class="block container" id="features">
      <div class="section-head">
        <h2>Everything you need to run the books, so you can focus on the cut.</h2>
        <p>Built around how barbers actually work: quick walk-ins, recurring regulars, and clients who expect a text back fast.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="features">
        <div class="feature">
          <div class="icon">&#128197;</div>
          <h3>Online booking</h3>
          <p>Clients pick their barber, service, and time from your link, Instagram bio, or Google profile. No back-and-forth texts.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="feature">
          <div class="icon">&#128276;</div>
          <h3>Automatic reminders</h3>
          <p>Text and email reminders go out before every appointment. Clients can confirm or reschedule with one tap.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="feature">
          <div class="icon">&#128101;</div>
          <h3>Client profiles</h3>
          <p>Save cut preferences, notes, and visit history. Remember that the client wants a low taper and hates small talk.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="feature">
          <div class="icon">&#128179;</div>
          <h3>Deposits and payments</h3>
          <p>Collect deposits to cut down on no-shows, or take full payment at booking. Tips go straight to the barber.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="feature">
          <div class="icon">&#128336;</div>
          <h3>Flexible availability</h3>
          <p>Set working hours, breaks, and days off per barber. Block time for lunch, errands, or a vacation with a single click.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="feature">
          <div class="icon">&#128200;</div>
          <h3>Shop insights</h3>
          <p>See your busiest hours, top services, and most loyal clients. Know where your chair earns the most.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- How it works -->
    <section class="block container" id="how" style="padding-top: 0;">
      <div class="section-head">
        <h2>Up and running in an afternoon.</h2>
        <p>No IT team, no complicated setup.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="steps">
        <div class="step">
          <span class="step-num">Step 01</span>
          <h3>Add your services and hours</h3>
          <p>List your cuts, add prices and durations, and set your schedule. Import your existing client list in a few clicks.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="step">
          <span class="step-num">Step 02</span>
          <h3>Share your booking link</h3>
          <p>Add it to your Instagram, Google Business profile, and text signature. Clients book themselves.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="step">
          <span class="step-num">Step 03</span>
          <h3>Keep your chair full</h3>
          <p>Reminders handle confirmations, and cancellations open slots that waitlisted clients can grab automatically.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Pricing -->
    <section class="block pricing-section" id="pricing">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="section-head">
          <h2>Simple pricing. No surprises.</h2>
          <p>Start free, then upgrade when your book gets busy. Cancel anytime.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="plans">
          <div class="plan">
            <h3>Solo</h3>
            <div class="price">$0<small> / month</small></div>
            <p class="plan-desc">For independent barbers getting started.</p>
            <ul>
              <li>1 barber</li>
              <li>Online booking page</li>
              <li>Email reminders</li>
              <li>Up to 50 bookings per month</li>
            </ul>
            <a href="#" class="btn btn-secondary">Get started free</a>
          </div>

          <div class="plan featured">
            <span class="plan-badge">Most popular</span>
            <h3>Chair</h3>
            <div class="price">$29<small> / month</small></div>
            <p class="plan-desc">For working barbers who want a full calendar.</p>
            <ul>
              <li>1 barber</li>
              <li>Unlimited bookings</li>
              <li>SMS and email reminders</li>
              <li>Deposits and online payments</li>
              <li>Client profiles and notes</li>
            </ul>
            <a href="#" class="btn btn-primary">Start 14-day free trial</a>
          </div>

          <div class="plan">
            <h3>Shop</h3>
            <div class="price">$79<small> / month</small></div>
            <p class="plan-desc">For barbershops with a team.</p>
            <ul>
              <li>Up to 6 barbers</li>
              <li>Everything in Chair</li>
              <li>Shared calendar and reporting</li>
              <li>Waitlist automation</li>
              <li>Priority support</li>
            </ul>
            <a href="#" class="btn btn-secondary">Start 14-day free trial</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Testimonials -->
    <section class="block container">
      <div class="section-head">
        <h2>Barbers who switched and stayed.</h2>
      </div>

      <div class="quotes">
        <div class="quote">
          <p>"I used to spend my lunch break answering texts about availability. Now the calendar fills itself and my phone stays in my pocket."</p>
          <div class="quote-author">
            <strong>Marcus T.</strong>
            <span>Independent barber, Atlanta</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="quote">
          <p>"The reminders alone paid for the subscription. Our no-show rate dropped noticeably in the first month."</p>
          <div class="quote-author">
            <strong>Dani R.</strong>
            <span>Owner, Northside Cuts</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="quote">
          <p>"Setting up my chair took one afternoon. My regulars book their own standing appointments now, and I haven't had to chase anyone down since."</p>
          <div class="quote-author">
            <strong>Jamal W.</strong>
            <span>Barber and shop owner, Chicago</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Final CTA -->
    <section class="final-cta">
      <div class="container">
        <h2>Your chair is waiting.</h2>
        <p>Start your free trial today and get your first booking link in minutes.</p>
        <a href="#" class="btn btn-primary">Start your 14-day free trial</a>
      </div>
    </section>

  </main>

  <footer>
    <div class="container footer-inner">
      <div>&copy; 2026 ChairTime. All rights reserved.</div>
      <nav class="footer-links">
        <a href="#">Privacy</a>
        <a href="#">Terms</a>
        <a href="#">Support</a>
        <a href="#">Contact</a>
      </nav>
    </div>
  </footer>

</body>
</html>
```
